   "description": "Participants who are naïve to treatment with an anti-CD3xCD20 bispecific antibody (group 1) will receive glofitamab as a single-agent administered as an IV infusion in a step-up dosing schedule starting with 2.5 mg on day 8 of cycle 1, and10 mg on day 15 of cycle 1, and 30 mg on day 1 from cycle 2 onward until disease progression or withdrawal, for a maximum of 12 cycles (part 3).",
   "interventionNames": [
