   "description": "Allocetra is a cell-based therapy consisting of non-HLA-matched allogeneic peripheral blood mononuclear cells, induced to an apoptotic stable state.",
   "armGroupLabels": [
    "Allocetra"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "OTHER",
   "name": "Placebo",
   "description": "The control used in this study will be placebo. Placebo solution containing all excipients except for the Allocetra cells.",
