   "measure": "Western Ontario and McMaster Universities Arthritis Index (WOMAC) Function score at 3 months",
   "description": "The change from baseline for the WOMAC Function score at 3 months between Allocetra and Placebo. Total Function score ranges from 0 (No difficulty) to 170 (Extreme difficulty).",
