 "briefTitle": "A Study of CA201A Eye Drops to Prevent Corneal Endothelial Cell Loss in Patients Undergoing Cataract Surgery",
 "officialTitle": "A Multicentre, Randomised, Double-masked, Vehicle-controlled, Parallel-arm, Phase 2 Study of the Safety and Efficacy of CA201A for the Prevention of Corneal Endothelial Cell Loss in Subjects Undergoing Cataract Surgery",
