   "label": "LP-300 in Combination with Pemetrexed and Carboplatin",
   "type": "EXPERIMENTAL",
   "description": "LP-300 (investigational drug) + Pemetrexed and Carboplatin (standard of care chemotherapies)\n\nDosing occurs on Day 1 of a 21-day cycle.",
