  {
   "measure": "Barthel Index (BI)",
   "description": "Functional recovery after stroke onset is measured by the Barthel Index (BI). BI score from 0-100, higher scores mean better outcome. The investigators measure and compare the BI score for ischemic stroke patients who received Neuroncell-EX and control treatments.",
