   "description": "DLBS1442 is supplied as 100 mg oral capsules. Participants will receive either :\n\n1. DLBS1442 100 mg + Placebo; or\n2. DLBS1442 100 mg + DLBS1442 100 mg three times daily for up to 5 consecutive days during one menstrual cycle, according to the randomized treatment assignment.\n\nTreatment may be discontinued once complete pain relief is achieved (Visual Analogue Scale \\[VAS\\] = 0).",
   "armGroupLabels": [
    "DLBS1442 100 mg",
    "DLBS1442 200 mg"
   ],
   "otherNames": [
    "Dismeno"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "DRUG",
